---
// Section 02 — Brand Learner
// Personal editorial experience. Observations, fragments, curiosity.
---

<section 
  id="learner" 
  class="relative min-h-[100svh] w-full py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 border-b border-brand-border/30 bg-brand-black flex flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden"
>
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto w-full my-auto">
    
    <!-- Section label -->
    <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-neutral-500 tracking-widest uppercase mb-8 lg:mb-12 reveal-on-scroll">
      02 — Brand Learner
    </div>

    <!-- Two-column editorial layout -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 lg:gap-20 items-start">
      
      <!-- Left: Visual fragment + archival photo -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-10 reveal-on-scroll">
        
        <!-- Portrait / Studio photograph -->
        <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border/40 overflow-hidden group">
          <img 
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499750310107-5fef28a66643?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" 
            alt="Studio desk with notebooks and working tools"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover img-monochrome group-hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-700"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 p-4 bg-brand-black/80 font-mono text-[10px] text-neutral-400 flex justify-between">
            <span>Studio desk, Calicut</span>
            <span>2025</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Observation notes -->
        <div class="space-y-3 border-l-2 border-brand-border/60 pl-5">
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Observation rules</div>
          <div class="space-y-2 text-neutral-300 font-sans text-xs font-light leading-relaxed">
            <p>01 — Listen before drawing.</p>
            <p>02 — Document regional typography.</p>
            <p>03 — Prefer conviction over volume.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Narrative -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-10 reveal-on-scroll">
        
        <h2 class="text-editorial-heading text-white">
          I learn brands by observing how stories age.
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-5 font-sans font-light text-neutral-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          <p>
            I did not learn branding inside corporate boardrooms. My education was built slowly — observing trade ships along the Malabar coastline, studying printed monographs, and hand-lettering shopfront signs in Kozhikode.
          </p>
          <p>
            When you strip away digital noise, a truth remains: <span class="text-white font-normal">the most memorable brands are discovered by quiet observers who know how to listen.</span>
          </p>
          <p>
            Close is my personal practice. No account managers, no junior handoffs, no templates. Every project is an unhurried collaboration between two parties who care about craft.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Quote block — no italic, just weight + border -->
        <div class="border-l-2 border-white/30 pl-6 py-2">
          <p class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white font-medium leading-snug max-w-xl">
            "To learn a brand is to accept that you do not possess all answers on day one."
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Compact metrics -->
        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-brand-border/30 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div>
            <span class="block font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-white font-semibold">10+</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1 block">Years observing</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-white font-semibold">4–6</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1 block">Projects / year</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-white font-semibold">Direct</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1 block">Practitioner</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
